  "slug": "salon-client-intake-form",
  "name": "Salon Client Intake",
  "description": "Learn a new salon client's hair type, color and chemical history, scalp sensitivities, allergies, styling routine and inspiration photos.",
  "category": "Wellness & Beauty",
  "seoTitle": "Free Salon Client Intake Form Template",
  "seoDescription": "Salon client intake form template for hair history, color and chemical services, allergies, scalp concerns, styling habits and inspiration photos. Plan well.",
  "keywords": [
